# Qaseeda Burdah Shareef - supplementary text
# Format: T|title|author ; C|chapter ; V|arabic|transliteration|english
T|Qaseeda Burdah Shareef|Imam al-Busiri
C|The Refrain
V|مَوْلَايَ صَلِّ وَسَلِّمْ دَائِمًا أَبَدًا|Mawlaya salli wa sallim da'iman abada|O my Master, send blessings and peace always and forever
V|عَلَى حَبِيبِكَ خَيْرِ الْخَلْقِ كُلِّهِمِ|'Ala habibika khayril-khalqi kullihimi|Upon Your beloved, the best of all creation
C|Chapter 1: On Love and Yearning
V|أَمِنْ تَذَكُّرِ جِيرَانٍ بِذِي سَلَمِ|Amin tadhakkuri jiranin bi Dhi Salami|Is it because of your remembrance of the neighbours of Dhi Salam
V|مَزَجْتَ دَمْعًا جَرَى مِنْ مُقْلَةٍ بِدَمِ|Mazajta dam'an jara min muqlatin bi dami|That you mixed tears flowing from an eye with blood
V|أَمْ هَبَّتِ الرِّيحُ مِنْ تِلْقَاءِ كَاظِمَةٍ|Am habbatir-rihu min tilqa'i Kadhimatin|Or did the wind blow from the direction of Kadhimah
V|وَأَوْمَضَ الْبَرْقُ فِي الظَّلْمَاءِ مِنْ إِضَمِ|Wa awmadal-barqu fidh-dhalma'i min Idhami|And the lightning flash in the darkness from Idham
V|فَمَا لِعَيْنَيْكَ إِنْ قُلْتَ اكْفُفَا هَمَتَا|Fama li-'aynayka in qulta-kfufa hamata|What is wrong with your eyes, if you tell them to stop, they weep
V|وَمَا لِقَلْبِكَ إِنْ قُلْتَ اسْتَفِقْ يَهِمِ|Wa ma li-qalbika in qulta-stafiq yahimi|And what is wrong with your heart, if you tell it to awaken, it wanders
C|Chapter 10: On Intimate Conversation and Cherished Hopes
V|أَبْيَاتُهَا قَدْ أَتَتْ سِتِّينَ مَعْ مِائَةٍ|Abyatuha qad atat sittina ma mi'atin|Its verses number one hundred and sixty
V|فَرِّجْ بِهَا كَرْبَنَا يَا وَاسِعَ الكَرَمِ|Farrij biha karbana ya wasi'al-karami|Ease, by them, all of our difficulties, O Boundlessly Generous Lord
